<title>USA: Honeywell wins order from Amoco.</title>
<headline>Honeywell wins order from Amoco.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honeywell Inc Monday said Amoco Corp has ordered comprehensive process control, process safety, and data acquisition systems for several offshore oil platforms and an onshore gas production plant in Trinidad.</p>
<p>The systems, valued at several million dollars, includes Honeywell s SCAN 3000 with Allen-Bradley programmable logic controllers, Honeywell smart transmitters and engineering and commissioning services, Honeywell said in a statement.</p>
